WEBVTT

00:39.415 --> 00:40.572
- Hah!
- Dammit!

00:40.664 --> 00:41.409
Move!

00:41.975 --> 00:43.101
Nire?!

02:39.889 --> 02:44.196
I hardly know any more than Suo does.

02:45.163 --> 02:49.593
KEEL is a small-scale team with
a dragon skeleton logo.

02:50.135 --> 02:53.483
I have no idea what they formed to accomplish.

02:53.926 --> 02:56.953
All I've heard are rumors of criminal activity.

02:57.840 --> 02:59.876
What do you think they're all about?

03:00.196 --> 03:01.803
I don't give a damn.

03:02.055 --> 03:07.200
No decent person could pull that shit.

03:07.858 --> 03:08.978
Makes me sick.

03:13.612 --> 03:15.556
It doesn't matter who they are,

03:16.252 --> 03:18.849
I just have to get that Nagato guy out.

03:19.581 --> 03:24.092
And anyone who tries to stop me
is getting knocked out.

03:31.126 --> 03:34.098
Yeah, if they don't like it, we'll just fight 'em.

03:34.547 --> 03:36.695
Thanks, guys.

03:37.452 --> 03:40.596
But those KEEL guys all fight together,

03:40.861 --> 03:42.960
even against a single opponent.

03:43.815 --> 03:47.926
They don't hesitate to use bats
or two-by-fours, either.

03:48.750 --> 03:50.886
So please, don't let your guard down.

03:55.587 --> 03:57.495
Is this the place?

03:59.600 --> 04:00.418
Yeah.

04:01.267 --> 04:03.440
This is it.

04:07.673 --> 04:09.193
KEEL's base.

04:19.009 --> 04:20.492
It's locked up.

04:22.424 --> 04:24.080
How do we get in?

04:28.440 --> 04:31.513
What's with the damn dings?!
They're pissing me off!

04:31.538 --> 04:32.904
S-Sorry!

04:33.070 --> 04:34.172
But they're…

04:41.667 --> 04:44.560
Sugishita, I don't think that's gonna work…

04:56.535 --> 04:58.000
So violent.

04:58.116 --> 05:01.483
Ooh, there's that crazy power we know an' love!

05:14.356 --> 05:15.883
Oh, my, my.

05:16.510 --> 05:18.720
We got a whole gaggle of guests.

05:19.464 --> 05:22.000
The reservation was for just one, you know.

05:22.658 --> 05:23.575
Well, whatev.

05:24.030 --> 05:26.886
Hey, Nagato! Your pal's here!

05:27.120 --> 05:29.175
Why not give him a wave?

05:31.372 --> 05:32.424
Look!

05:33.206 --> 05:34.615
He says hi!

05:36.043 --> 05:37.224
Anzai?!

05:37.347 --> 05:38.984
What are you doing?! Move!

05:40.147 --> 05:43.070
Give him to us.

05:43.280 --> 05:45.261
Whaaat? Don't wanna.

05:45.747 --> 05:48.609
This guy ain't even close to his quota,

05:48.756 --> 05:50.100
so he's still got a lot…

05:50.100 --> 05:52.295
I didn't ask for your opinion.

05:53.046 --> 05:54.172
Hand him over.

05:59.193 --> 06:00.166
Bleh.

06:00.947 --> 06:05.089
I see. Well, if you're gonna get
in our way, there's no choice.

06:05.569 --> 06:08.080
We'll knock you out and take him.

06:11.901 --> 06:14.873
Whaaat? No way. So scaaary.

06:15.526 --> 06:18.098
You're raiding us with so many guys.

06:18.258 --> 06:20.646
That doesn't seem very heroic, you know.

06:21.366 --> 06:24.086
So I guess that means we can do that, too.

06:31.169 --> 06:33.876
Hey, now, this ain't like you told us.

06:34.535 --> 06:37.009
What part of this is small-scale?!

06:41.704 --> 06:44.633
Dammit! I'm sorry, guys!

06:46.744 --> 06:48.492
Why you apologizin'?

06:50.129 --> 06:52.184
S'just three or four for each of us.

06:52.387 --> 06:53.840
This'll be a cinch!

06:54.024 --> 06:57.058
Let's clean 'em up quick so we can go home.

06:57.323 --> 07:00.547
I'm glad you seem to be
extra motivated, too, Sugishita.

07:00.904 --> 07:05.458
There's no way Umemiya would
let them get away with this.

07:11.329 --> 07:13.212
You guys can sit back.

07:15.144 --> 07:16.990
I can handle this myself.

07:17.384 --> 07:19.643
Just handle any loose balls.

07:20.209 --> 07:22.701
Loose balls? What is this, soccer?

07:23.643 --> 07:25.483
Thassa good one!

07:25.532 --> 07:27.083
And unexpected.

07:27.396 --> 07:29.747
Soccer's not a solo sport, y'know!

07:30.030 --> 07:33.243
Bein' grade rep don't mean
you can be the only cool one.

07:33.540 --> 07:35.113
Screw that.

07:35.286 --> 07:37.550
Who do you think we are?

07:38.227 --> 07:39.458
Huh.

07:39.827 --> 07:41.821
The vibe's changed.

07:44.356 --> 07:47.206
Alright, guys!

07:47.440 --> 07:49.507
Go get 'em!

07:55.421 --> 07:58.615
Don't take Furin lightly!

08:05.015 --> 08:05.969
Hrah!

08:08.184 --> 08:09.803
Kurita!

08:19.532 --> 08:20.806
Hah!

08:20.970 --> 08:22.289
Nice one, Kakiuchi!

08:34.695 --> 08:36.024
Are you okay, Nire?

08:37.046 --> 08:37.926
Y-Yeah.

08:40.276 --> 08:41.236
Take th… agh!

08:43.556 --> 08:45.809
I knew Sugishita was strong,

08:46.030 --> 08:49.310
but I didn't know how much ass Sakura kicked!

08:55.667 --> 08:58.892
So those five are the toughest ones, huh?

09:00.861 --> 09:02.430
What are you doing, Anzai?!

09:04.036 --> 09:05.261
Let's move!

09:07.975 --> 09:09.409
Open a path!

09:10.172 --> 09:11.224
Push 'em back!

09:15.304 --> 09:16.184
Oooh!

09:16.307 --> 09:18.276
They're coming! Here they come!

09:21.230 --> 09:22.356
What…?

09:26.553 --> 09:28.055
An… zai?

09:31.667 --> 09:34.566
I'm sorry, sir.

09:35.396 --> 09:38.369
You bastard!

09:39.384 --> 09:40.726
You can't come in here.

09:45.070 --> 09:48.615
You're being too rowdy, sir!

10:01.440 --> 10:02.400
Anzai!

10:09.120 --> 10:11.384
Okay, then. Starting now…

10:12.295 --> 10:14.726
Our VIPs are joining in.

10:15.378 --> 10:17.710
Huh? What's your deal?

10:20.806 --> 10:23.298
We got this, guys!

10:23.300 --> 10:25.095
Beat 'em all down in one go!

10:48.289 --> 10:51.421
Alright, let's move on to round two!

10:51.907 --> 10:54.935
Every one of these bastards
is smiling like a fool…

10:55.267 --> 10:56.707
Look out, now!

10:59.550 --> 11:03.040
You can't win if you just dodge!

11:05.341 --> 11:08.393
Aww, look at him. What's wrong?

11:09.833 --> 11:12.184
You don't know when to stop yapping, do you?

11:16.381 --> 11:19.513
Whether it's a fist or a
two-by-four, a hit's a hit.

11:19.710 --> 11:20.553
But, y'know,

11:21.156 --> 11:24.775
villains always lose in the end.

11:29.021 --> 11:31.095
You're pretty mobile for your size.

11:31.507 --> 11:32.984
And you seem tough, too.

11:33.532 --> 11:34.720
This'll be fun.

11:38.541 --> 11:42.689
Dammit, you're twistin' all about
like a damn woman.

11:42.886 --> 11:45.987
How rude. Call me "supple".

11:46.184 --> 11:51.913
And the idea that supple means
womanly is so behind the times.

11:52.369 --> 11:54.898
Sorry, princess.

11:58.990 --> 12:02.307
This'll be cake, with you
protectin' the guy behind you.

12:02.627 --> 12:04.387
I-I'm sorry.

12:05.175 --> 12:06.418
You don't get it.

12:06.726 --> 12:08.701
I'm even stronger like this.

12:08.910 --> 12:10.646
What, you serious?

12:10.732 --> 12:12.289
Or just actin' tough?

12:13.113 --> 12:13.963
Dammit!

12:14.541 --> 12:16.436
We're hardly making a dent!

12:17.803 --> 12:18.609
Look out!

12:28.203 --> 12:29.661
So rude!

12:29.740 --> 12:33.532
You can't just leave me
for someone else! You cheater, you!

12:35.187 --> 12:36.630
Nice miss!

12:36.630 --> 12:37.476
…it.

12:37.833 --> 12:40.307
Move it, bastard!

12:45.846 --> 12:48.381
I'm happy you're payin' attention to me,

12:48.486 --> 12:51.630
but you gotta watch your surroundings, too.

12:55.495 --> 13:00.123
Figures. Sendin' backup to cover
those five was a good call.

13:00.603 --> 13:04.578
Stop them, and then it's just a numbers game.

13:04.861 --> 13:09.723
And with them surrounded, they gotta watch
their backs and can't fight at full force.

13:10.147 --> 13:13.870
This is great. A one-sided slaughter.

13:14.492 --> 13:17.784
I didn't think he'd be so stupid as to come alone,

13:18.295 --> 13:21.680
but he didn't bring much help.
And only first-years!

13:22.012 --> 13:23.889
Cheep cheep cheep cheep cheep!

13:24.203 --> 13:27.716
The idiot just brought a bunch of little chicks!

13:30.836 --> 13:32.363
Th-This is bad!

13:33.021 --> 13:35.280
They've clearly got Furin on the ropes!

13:36.436 --> 13:40.904
And Suo can't move freely with me behind him…

13:41.938 --> 13:43.612
What am I doing?

13:44.480 --> 13:47.212
I came, just like I did for Lion's Head,

13:48.055 --> 13:50.246
but I didn't fight then,

13:51.033 --> 13:53.200
so I figured it'd work the same today…

13:54.621 --> 13:55.698
So lame.

13:57.236 --> 13:59.040
You're not lame.

14:08.006 --> 14:08.787
Nire?!

14:08.861 --> 14:10.953
Whoa, there! No lookin' away!

14:11.729 --> 14:13.224
I'm Furin, too!

14:13.883 --> 14:17.704
I can't fight, I can't defend myself…

14:18.246 --> 14:20.923
But I can't just run, either!

14:24.012 --> 14:26.067
The hell, man?! Get off!

14:42.523 --> 14:46.233
I should have known this wouldn't work out.

14:47.513 --> 14:49.716
I'm sorry, Sakura.

15:06.498 --> 15:08.609
Wh-Why are you…

15:27.150 --> 15:29.292
K-Kaji…

15:29.796 --> 15:33.753
Damn, you guys'rrre gettin' beat to hell.

15:34.289 --> 15:35.766
Enomoto…

15:37.064 --> 15:38.110
Kusumi…

15:39.643 --> 15:42.584
Glad we made it in time, man.

15:45.218 --> 15:46.707
Hey, look.

15:47.440 --> 15:50.030
Headphones and a lollipop. That's Kaji, right?

15:50.492 --> 15:51.236
Yeah.

15:51.864 --> 15:57.200
They say once he gets going, he won't stop
until his opponent's a bloody mess.

15:57.815 --> 16:00.061
Oh? What now?

16:00.572 --> 16:02.812
Backup's here, huh?

16:03.304 --> 16:05.753
And second-years, at that.

16:07.913 --> 16:13.667
Hmm… Well, I don't know what you've heard
about why this fight started,

16:13.932 --> 16:16.640
but your team's about protecting the town, yeah?

16:17.027 --> 16:21.329
We just had some business with
that guy. Nagato's friend.

16:22.135 --> 16:24.886
That has nothing to do with Furin, does it?

16:28.221 --> 16:30.900
And yet you turned this into such a big…

16:30.900 --> 16:32.073
How stupid are you?

16:33.606 --> 16:34.276
Huh?

16:34.726 --> 16:36.701
It has everything to do with us.

16:38.929 --> 16:40.861
We're here, aren't we?

16:42.449 --> 16:46.609
You're right that Bofurin protects the town.

16:47.009 --> 16:53.206
And that means protecting the town,
its people, and their feelings.

16:54.067 --> 16:56.590
Furin's people are still part of that.

16:57.070 --> 16:59.692
And anything important to them…

17:00.492 --> 17:02.941
gets our protection.

17:06.566 --> 17:09.889
Huh? What's that about? I dun geddit.

17:10.092 --> 17:12.123
Seriously, how stupid are you?

17:13.064 --> 17:15.907
You raised hands against Furin.

17:17.060 --> 17:23.040
You had to know what would happen next, shithead!

17:26.436 --> 17:29.433
Uuugh, so noisy.

17:29.864 --> 17:33.415
I tried to warn you, but I don't care anymore.

17:34.184 --> 17:36.098
What're you guys afraid of?

17:36.560 --> 17:38.295
There's only three more.

17:38.953 --> 17:40.258
Clean 'em up.

17:45.249 --> 17:46.818
Do you guys…

17:48.843 --> 17:50.209
wanna end up like this?

18:12.744 --> 18:15.120
Enomoto, Kusumi, you two stay down here.

18:15.440 --> 18:16.221
Got it.

18:17.156 --> 18:18.910
I'll go up there…

18:19.864 --> 18:21.396
and kick his ass.

18:24.953 --> 18:27.138
Sorry, Kusumi.

18:28.467 --> 18:31.661
Oh, you want me to… stay here, is that it?

18:34.947 --> 18:36.246
Yeah…

18:38.547 --> 18:41.680
I'm so pathetic…

18:43.169 --> 18:47.292
Listen up! We'rrre herrre to back you guys up!

18:47.396 --> 18:52.424
Just focus on the jerrrks in frrront of you!

19:04.510 --> 19:05.680
You came for me?

19:09.175 --> 19:10.541
Oh, that?

19:12.184 --> 19:13.956
I kicked him down a bit ago.

19:14.836 --> 19:17.667
Wow, so kind. That's a surprise.

19:18.184 --> 19:19.273
Wait!

19:19.716 --> 19:21.470
I'll take the guy upstairs!

19:21.636 --> 19:22.800
Don't touch him!

19:23.655 --> 19:27.907
Come on, what are you saying when you have me?

19:28.160 --> 19:31.901
You told me to try to deal with things on my own!

19:32.104 --> 19:33.569
So I'll deal with him!

19:33.809 --> 19:36.510
Don't go butting in!

19:40.467 --> 19:43.920
Do you even know what's going on here?

19:44.529 --> 19:45.673
Huh?!

19:46.036 --> 19:48.683
Stay outta this!

19:54.523 --> 19:56.966
Crap, is he even human?

19:59.710 --> 20:01.329
Shut up for a bit.

20:02.172 --> 20:04.030
I'm talking to him right now.

20:05.433 --> 20:09.403
You're not thinking about anything but
beating him up, are you?

20:09.575 --> 20:11.618
O-Of course not!

20:11.883 --> 20:13.163
What's wrong with that?!

20:17.273 --> 20:18.430
What are you…

20:19.772 --> 20:20.966
Are you an idiot?!

20:21.433 --> 20:23.427
Because he got in your head,

20:23.636 --> 20:25.507
and this weakling slowed you down…

20:25.510 --> 20:26.430
Hey!

20:27.372 --> 20:29.532
You didn't have their backs!

20:31.636 --> 20:34.787
What's your number-one priority?!

20:35.495 --> 20:38.947
If you don't help them, why are you grade rep?!

20:44.012 --> 20:46.676
Watch over the people around you, and help them!

20:52.153 --> 20:55.150
But… Even so, I…

20:56.276 --> 20:57.766
I can't forgive him.

20:59.883 --> 21:01.206
What a coincidence.

21:03.556 --> 21:04.720
I can't, either.

21:05.895 --> 21:09.495
I'll punch him enough for both of us.

21:11.033 --> 21:13.649
You do what you're supposed to.

21:15.138 --> 21:16.203
In the face.

21:17.563 --> 21:20.012
I was gonna punch him straight in the face.

21:21.747 --> 21:23.292
At least ten times!

21:28.036 --> 21:32.689
Whew, lucky me. I couldn't have
handled a monster like him.

21:32.690 --> 21:33.846
Dammit…

21:33.944 --> 21:34.363
Huh?

21:34.658 --> 21:35.735
Dammit!

21:36.683 --> 21:37.267
What?

21:38.560 --> 21:40.707
The hell is my problem?

21:43.901 --> 21:46.018
I'm so lame it's not even funny.

21:46.412 --> 21:49.846
- What, you go crazy?
- Let's get this over with, blondie.

21:50.620 --> 21:51.772
Sorry,

21:53.366 --> 21:56.043
but I don't have time to play with you.

21:57.045 --> 22:00.090
[Rage]

23:30.904 --> 23:34.535
We're finally here… KEEL's base.

23:34.670 --> 23:38.012
KEEL… They're bad news.

23:38.276 --> 23:42.886
The blue dragon skeleton on their
white hoodies is so creepy.

23:43.304 --> 23:48.406
They all wear the same uniforms,
but Lion's Head felt more unified.

23:48.486 --> 23:54.443
Apparently they force their members to
buy those uniforms, and they're expensive!

23:55.120 --> 23:58.412
I can't go losing to jerks like that.
